// stance on the base layer; the guard of the weapon (ready), a blow / parry / draw (action) play over it from the waist
// up, a hit is a flinch ADDED to the pose (react), the right fist closes round the prop (grip). Layer clips fade in and
// out (CUE blend_in / blend_out), whole-body states cross-fade (blend_seconds); only a knock-out falls. Hand props are
// the prefabs of art-source/combat-props (Resources/CombatProps, built by the staging assembler) set by their grip frame
